-input contract, finite byte/report caps and executable fictional example are documented in EXPERT_SUBMISSION_AUDIT.md. The focused test and existing verify command register 48 named fixtures covering delivered blank50/browser exports, role and packet tampering, partial fields/notes, original pins, Unicode, exact bounds and side effects.\n\nSigned clean source182e2a73 is frozen from actualmain27f12442. Existing remote CI is the first runtime; these fixtures are written, with runtime and independent source/retained-CI gates pending. No version, public dataset, website or npm release is included.\n","created_at":"2026-10-02T17:34:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T17:34:55Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"13b54b82fbce1f249f64b06be5732f70c087cb7b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/367/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/367/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/issues/367/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/statuses/182e2a732a26ce36bbcf6cd3825675dfdf64f0df","head":{"label":"arhancanli:assist/expert-submission-audit-20261002","ref":"assist/expert-submission-audit-20261002","sha":"182e2a732a26ce36bbcf6cd3825675dfdf64f0df","user":{"login":"arhancanli","id":315329124,"node_id":"U_kgDOEsuKZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315329124?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli","html_url":"https://github.com/arhancanli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/gists{/gist_id}",